    <!-- ===== wrist cameras (scripts/update_wrist_camera_srdf.py) =====
         Pairs inherited from *_gripper_base_link, which the bracket clamps
         onto and the camera bolts to, plus the pairs within the assembly
         itself (all three are in permanent contact by construction).
         Without these MoveIt sees a self-collision in EVERY arm state.
         Left-vs-right is deliberately NOT excluded, matching the gripper.
         Regenerate with the MoveIt Setup Assistant for a fresh analysis:
         the camera reaches ~7 cm off the axis the bare gripper occupies. -->
